title: ASPD Congress - Party Program faces the change.
subtitle: **National Socialist** vision of the ASPD faces the crisis.
tags: event
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
view-if: year == 1928 and month >= 10 and weeks >= 2 and aspd_votes_pct < 0.6
priority: -1

= ASPD Congress

On the 12th of [+ month +], the party leader of the ASPD, [+ aspd_party_leader +], has pushed for a change in the party program to shift away from the **National Bolshevik** direction of the party in order to please disillusioned right wing social democrats and bourgeouisie parties in Saxony. This would only be possible with direct confrontation with their "National Bolshevik" wing, which is led by Ernst Niekisch and August Winnig (their presence and their rhetoric contributed to the party gaining the 'social fascist' label, due to their attempts to reconcile nationalist patriotism and socialism). If [+ aspd_party_leader +] is successful in his changes, the ASPD will drift away from the nationalist camp and in theory turn make more appealing to **social republicans** and **right wing socialists**.

In retaliation, Ernst Niekisch has pushed for the removal of [+ aspd_party_leader +], which if succesful, would have the **National Bolsheviks** take over the party. 

- @resultant_aspd: Ernst Niekisch faces grave danger to his political aspirations...

@resultant_aspd
on-arrival: {!

Q.aspd_nb_survival_points = Q.aspd_nb_survival_points || 0;

if ((Q.nationalism * 1.1) + Q.aspd_votes_pct > 15) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1;
if (Q.ideology == "Left") Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1;
if (Q.ideology == "reformist") Q.aspd_nb_survival_points -= 1;
if (Q.spd_r < 29 || Q.spd_votes < 26.4) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1
if (Q.z_relation + Q.dvp_relation + Q.ddp_relation > 170) {
    Q.aspd_nb_survival_points -= 1;
} else {
    Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1;
}
if (Q.dnvp_party_leader == "Walther Lambach") Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1;

if (Q.spd_in_government <= 0) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1

if (Q.peoples_party) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points -= 10;
if (Q.peoples_party_support > 1) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points -= Q.peoples_party_support;

if (Q.aspd_pct > 0.4) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1;
if (Q.jungdo_formed > 0) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1;
if (Q.nsdap_pct < 3) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1;
if (Q.reformists_resign) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points -= 1;
if (Q.unions_independent) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 2;
if (Q.labor_dissent > 30 && !Q.unions_independent) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1;
if (Q.jungdo_strength + Q.stahlhelm_strength > 800) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1;

// Sum votes_pct of all parties whose ideo_score is 16-20 (far-right band)
let farRightTotal = 0;
for (const p of Q.parties) {
    const scoreKey = p + '_ideo_score';
    const votesKey = p + '_votes_pct';
    if (Q[scoreKey] !== undefined && Q[scoreKey] >= 16 && Q[scoreKey] <= 20) {
        farRightTotal += (Q[votesKey] || 0);
    }
}
if (farRightTotal > 20) Q.aspd_nb_survival_points += 1;

!}
go-to: aspd_natbol_died if aspd_nb_survival_points < 6; aspd_natbol_survival if aspd_nb_survival_points >= 6 and aspd_nb_survival_points < 8; aspd_nb_assumes if aspd_nb_survival_points >= 8

@aspd_natbol_died

In an unsurprising turn of events, [+ aspd_party_leader +] has successfully pushed through his proposed changes, which has caused Ernst Niekisch and the "National Bolsheviks" to split from the party.

@aspd_natbol_survival
achievement: herbstingwer

With a stalemate ensuing, [+ aspd_party_leader +] has survived this attempt of being removed but at the same time the party program of the ASPD remains unchanged.

@aspd_nb_assumes
achievement: herbstingwer
on-arrival: aspd_ideology = "National Bolshevism"; aspd_party_leader = "Ernst Niekisch"

In an unexpected turn of events, Ernst Niekisch has sucesfully managed to get current leader removed and in a follow up party chair election, is elected to become the new party leader.
